  "title": "Salmon Twist",
  "description": "Salmon is marinated in a simple soy sauce and brown sugar sauce creating a salty-sweet complement to the salmon. Serve with rice!",
  "authors": [
    "Kelly Robertson"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-03-05T00:11:42-05:00",
